{
  "name": "Mailbox triage with Hesperan (IMAP, Auto or Review)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mailbox triage with Hesperan (IMAP)\n\n**Who it's for:** teams that share one inbox and forward mail to the right team by hand.\n\n**What it does:** each new email goes to a calibrated Hesperan decision profile. On **Auto** (the calibrated confidence reached the profile's threshold) it is forwarded to the team's address. On **Review** it goes to a triage address with Hesperan's suggestion, and a person decides.\n\n**Setup**\n1. In the Hesperan console, create and calibrate a profile (here `mail-routing`) with one answer per team, e.g. `billing`, `shipping`, `technical`.\n2. Add credentials: Hesperan (API key `hsp_…`), IMAP for the shared inbox, SMTP for sending.\n3. Edit the team addresses in **Forward to team** and the triage address in **Send to triage**.\n\nThe whole email text is sent to Hesperan and counts towards billing; trim it in the *State* field if needed.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "d2a0ee16-ad30-5c85-b908-440aa7a93667",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto\nForward to the team the profile chose.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e93adaac-22a5-53d5-9578-7cc2f10db2e3",
      "name": "Auto section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review\nA person decides; Hesperan's suggestion is included.",
